this is how JIT synth is gonna work:
jit input: JS
target: PHP

take JS seed. from JS seed, we construct JIT Constraint Templates -> to be referred to as JCT

JCTs will encode CFG shape. Function shape. Object shape. Type coercion. SSA properties (value reusage)

Control region: type 
        data op
        data op
        data op
        Control Region:
                data op
data op

Control regions are populated by data elements

the goal here is simple:
label every statement of the AST with its dependencies such that we can print an individual statement and it will automatically print its dependencies as well.

$h = 14;
$g = $h + 2;

printing the node $g will automatically print $h.
print the node $h will not print the node $g.
